  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant renews support to Flowminder, a nonprofit organization whose mission is to enable decision makers to access the data they need to transform the lives of vulnerable people, using mobile network operator, geospatial, and survey data at scale. It provides information and capacity strengthening to governments, mobile network operators, national and international agencies, and researchers for both humanitarian and development purposes. Ultimately, Flowminder strives to create a world in which decisions that can improve the lives of vulnerable people are based on the most appropriate evidence &#x2014; especially in Africa. (Strategy: Evidence-Informed Policymaking)</narrative>
  </description>
